THIRD-PARTY SOURCE DATA

The GCI aggregates 213 datasets from third-party providers, each of which
carries its own terms of use. This license covers the GCI's composite and
subindex scores and its documentation. It does not grant rights to the
underlying source data, and it does not override any provider's terms. Source
links for all 213 inputs are in the Codebook.

